Package: diagenesis
Version: 1.1.0
Title: An Object-Oriented Approach to Diagenetic Modelling
Authors@R: c(person("Filip", "Meysman", role = c("aut", "cph")),
    person("Sebastiaan", "van de Velde", role = c("cre", "ctb"),
           email = "sebastiaan.vandevelde@otago.ac.nz"))
Description: Routines for the construction of reactive transport models for aquatic sediments. The package contains tools to (1) create species, reaction and element objects, (2) monitor the progress of dynamic simulations, and (3) plot the simulation output.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: graphics
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/sevdevel/diagenesis
BugReports: https://github.com/sevdevel/diagenesis/issues
